<title>INDIA: Bus falls into India gorge, at least 57 dead.</title>
<headline>Bus falls into India gorge, at least 57 dead.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>At least 57 passengers were killed when their bus plunged into a deep gorge in northern India, All India Radio said on Friday.</p>
<p>The state-owned radio station said the accident occurred in the mountainous state of Himachal Pradesh. It gave no other details.</p>
